{
  "bodyHash": "rRztpfuNwAk=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162613103-be7451da-e652-4ed5-951c-57fb5f6d4b03.png\" width=\"1344\" height=\"820\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617338-99fd4cdb-b4d1-4594-8bd3-3f881f0f0608.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"><br>怪物佔領了你的村莊！</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你的世界將不再生成原版村莊，而是改為生成「敵對村莊」，這些村莊裡充滿了各種怪物。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617552-80038ed3-026b-42e1-8133-c00f6f9ad45e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">敵對村莊中生成的怪物數量</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">設定哪些怪物可以出現在敵對村莊中</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">村莊中會生成額外的寶箱，並可設定其內容物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">原版村莊的生成機率（預設為全部生成敵對村莊）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">禁止村民生成（預設村民會被怪物取代；可在設定中開啟保留村民功能以避免此情況）</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162635503-85e3e64b-3263-4498-944e-ba9741a3c88d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你喜歡這個模組，請考慮支持開發，任何支持都將非常感激。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">開發是無償的業餘活動，因此任何支持都能幫助我投入更多時間在此項目上。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你可以在 Patreon 上支持我，或者只是幫忙宣傳。</span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/someaddons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162637017-9a30d47b-493d-4743-9029-ac09dcc438f9.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"29\"></a></p><p>截圖：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/115146149-9062f200-a055-11eb-823a-817b748ded92.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"488\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/115146152-93f67900-a055-11eb-8c63-4e3dbecb03f1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"488\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/115146154-9658d300-a055-11eb-827c-f74ee4c04bed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"488\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/115146158-99ec5a00-a055-11eb-84e2-882c147342b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"488\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/115146159-9ce74a80-a055-11eb-9e8f-3e53865ee269.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"488\"></p>\n</div>",
